  "contract": [
    "Reset initializes app7AA WORD packedBCD9999 and app7AC WORD countdown1.",
    "Gated interrupt services decrement countdown and call the updater only at zero. Modal and service gates retain their different scopes.",
    "Two ABCD predecrements with X cleared add sourceWORD0001 to exactly the two bytes at7AA..7AB; first update wraps9999 to0000.",
    "All three graphics entries select four counter digits. LONG fetch includes adjacent countdown, which is not a32-bit BCD field.",
    "Amiga/alternate mode0 reset countdown432; alternate mode1 adds432. Both original instructions remain distinct."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No seconds, fixed tick frequency, timing equivalence or all-entry runtime claim.",
    "Original decoded-protection comparison is retained unchanged; no claim that its CCR is the BCD carry input.",
    "No new execution or code promotion. The preceding original-media latch run is a separate scope."
  ],
